And I got on the phone with Shane Davis, Chris McNeese, and when I got to the scene, fire department was there and they were trying to get the drainage cleared out.

187
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:43,200
I want to thank the fire department, the House Police Department, Chris McNeese and Public Works for acting fast and getting the road cleared.

188
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:49,200
I really appreciate their attention to the details and to making sure that the residents were safe.

