Then more recently, tragedy struck again. Last month, Keegan and McKinley Davis lost their lives at that same railroad tracks at Salty Bottom Road.

604
01:09:54,200 --> 01:10:01,200
Their family is here with us today. His father and his daughter.

605
01:10:01,200 --> 01:10:04,200
That actually was in the accident with them and survived.

