616
01:11:38,200 --> 01:11:46,200
Our community continues to endure the devastating consequences of this dangerous crossing.

617
01:11:46,200 --> 01:11:56,200
Families are grieving, lives have been forever changed, and the residents live with the fear that another preventable accident could happen anytime.

618
01:11:56,200 --> 01:12:01,200
We urge you to take action and help protect the citizens of our community from further loss.

